Hinterlib compiles for every platform that can be targeted with Inbound,
however many of those platforms are not actively used and probably won't
work out-of-the-box. Our active usage list so far includes:
- Apple macOS on AArch64
- GNU/Linux on x86-64

To compile, run GNU make on the command line. Job control is supported.
See Inbound's documentation for a full list of features and help guides.
